---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AI Strategy Session"
  description="60-90 minutes. Practical focus. Clear next steps. Request an AI strategy session to assess your current situation and identify realistic next steps for your organization."
  currentPath="/session"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-4">AI Strategy Session</h1>
      <p class="text-2xl text-gray-600 mb-8">60-90 minutes. Practical focus. Clear next steps.</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Most small organizations are in one of three places with AI:
        </p>

        <ol class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700">
          <li>Not really using it yet and don't know where to start</li>
          <li>People are using it, but there's no policy or strategy</li>
          <li>Tried a few things but not getting expected value</li>
        </ol>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          If any of those sound familiar, this session will help.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We'll Cover Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy mb-6">What we'll cover:</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gold mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              Your current situation
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gold mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              What you're trying to achieve
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gold mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              Quick wins and risks
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gold mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              Realistic next steps for your organization
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy mb-6">What you'll get:</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gold mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              Written summary of our discussion
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gold mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              Specific recommendations for your situation
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-gold mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              Clarity on whether deeper work makes sense
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Form Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-navy mb-8 text-center">Request a Session</h2>

      <form
        name="session-request"
        method="POST"
        data-netlify="true"
        netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
        class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-lg p-8"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="session-request" />
        <p class="hidden">
          <label>
            Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field" />
          </label>
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- Name -->
          <div>
            <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">
              Name <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="name"
              name="name"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold focus:border-transparent"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Title -->
          <div>
            <label for="title" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">
              Title <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="title"
              name="title"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold focus:border-transparent"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Organization -->
          <div>
            <label for="organization" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">
              Organization <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="organization"
              name="organization"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold focus:border-transparent"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Email -->
          <div>
            <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">
              Email <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <input
              type="email"
              id="email"
              name="email"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold focus:border-transparent"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Organization Type -->
          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-3">
              Organization type <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <label class="flex items-center">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="organization-type"
                  value="Small business"
                  required
                  class="h-4 w-4 text-gold focus:ring-gold border-gray-300"
                />
                <span class="ml-3 text-gray-700">Small business</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="organization-type"
                  value="Charity/Non-profit"
                  class="h-4 w-4 text-gold focus:ring-gold border-gray-300"
                />
                <span class="ml-3 text-gray-700">Charity/Non-profit</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="organization-type"
                  value="Professional services firm"
                  class="h-4 w-4 text-gold focus:ring-gold border-gray-300"
                />
                <span class="ml-3 text-gray-700">Professional services firm</span>
              </label>
              <label class="flex items-center">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="organization-type"
                  value="Other"
                  class="h-4 w-4 text-gold focus:ring-gold border-gray-300"
                />
                <span class="ml-3 text-gray-700">Other</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Interest -->
          <div>
            <label for="interest" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">
              What's prompting your interest in AI strategy right now? <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="interest"
              name="interest"
              rows="5"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold focus:border-transparent"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <!-- Submit Button -->
          <div>
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="w-full px-6 py-4 bg-gold text-navy rounded-md font-semibold hover:bg-yellow-500 transition-colors"
            >
              Submit Request
            </button>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center mt-4">
            I review requests personally and respond within 48 hours.
          </p>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
